  "handle": "clockclock-l-tidal",
  "description": "<p><em>ClockClock L (Tidal)</em> is crafted and milled from one block of aluminium, coated in dark blue and has shiny metal finish clock hands. The series is evocative of sunlight reflecting on the surface of water, while the cyclical and cumulative patterns shown by the clock-hands are themselves wave-like, a constant ebb and flow between reporting the time each minute.</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\">The artwork is hand-assembled in our Stockholm studio and is part of a highly limited edition of just 10 pieces.<br><br>Artworks from our ClockClock series are represented in the permanent collections of the Vitra Design Museum in Germany, the Musée International d'Horlogerie in Switzerland, and the Nationalmuseum in Sweden, among others.<br></p>\n<!---->",
